            "title": "Bank of England warns of AI valuations as Oracle looks to rebound",
            "description": "<p>Concerns are rising about the AI trade on Wall Street, and now the Bank of England is weighing in. The central bank warning in a new report that valuations are \"stretched.\" And it comes after a report from The Information raised worries about Oracle's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) profit margins from Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) chips. But Softbank (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SFTBY\">SFTBY</a>) is doubling down, as it announced an acquisition of ABB's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ABBN.SW\">ABBN.SW</a>) robotics unit for $5.4 billion.</p>\n<p>For more live coverage of markets watch the full episode of<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cLr6hc2-oMY&list=PLx28zU8ctIRqTE7Y4uXTY-S2oHlwDsL5c\"> Market Sunrise</a> and head to<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/\"> Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Concerns are rising about the AI trade on Wall Street, and now the Bank of England is weighing in. The central bank warning in a new report that valuations are \"stretched.\" And it comes after a report from The Information raised worries about Oracle's (ORCL) profit margins from Nvidia (NVDA) chips. But Softbank (SFTBY) is doubling down, as it announced an acquisition of ABB's (ABBN.SW) robotics unit for $5.4 billion. For more live coverage of markets watch the full episode of Market Sunrise and head to Yahoo Finance.",
